
%% Description
% This script compares global and local sleep spindles across multiple
% recording sessions. It analyzes phase and strength of phase-amplitude
% coupling (PAC), modulation index (MI), spindle amplitude, duration,
% and neuronal firing rate, using statistical tests and visualization
% to evaluate differences between global and local spindle events.


